            "notes_base": "Beijing's longest hutong, uniquely lined with European-style legation buildings from the early 20th century. Perfect light morning walk on arrival day — free, unhurried, no tickets. Key spots: Saint Michael's Catholic Church (哥特式圣弥厄尔大教堂), China Court Museum (中国法院博物馆), Belgian Embassy ruins (比利时使馆旧址). Connects naturally via West Xinglongstreet (西兴隆街) to Qianmen area. Verified via RedNote (879 likes, spring citywalk route). Allow 1.5-2 hours.",
            "notes_local": "北京最长的胡同，沿途林立20世纪初欧式使馆建筑。抵京第一天理想的轻松晨间漫步，免费无需门票。推荐打卡：圣弥厄尔大教堂、中国法院博物馆、比利时使馆旧址、台基厂大街。经西兴隆街可自然延伸至大栅栏前门区域。小红书已验证（879赞，春季citywalk路线）。建议游览1.5-2小时。",
            "opening_hours": "Open 24 hours (outdoor street)",
