        "location": "Datong",
        "attractions": [
          {
            "name_base": "Yungang Grottoes (云冈石窟)",
            "name_local": "云冈石窟",
            "location_base": "Yungang Town, Yungang District, Datong, Shanxi (16km west of city)",
            "location_local": "山西省大同市云冈区云冈镇",
            "coordinates": {
              "lat": 40.113157,
              "lng": 113.137763
            },
            "cost": 120,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "type_base": "UNESCO World Heritage Site",
            "type_local": "联合国教科文组织世界遗产",
            "notes_base": "TICKETS BOOKED for 12:30-14:30 slot. UNESCO World Heritage Site. 45,000+ Buddhist statues carved 5th-6th century across 53 grottoes. Priority grottoes: Caves 16-20 (Tanyao Five Caves — monumental seated Buddhas up to 17m), Caves 5-6 (painted ceilings, Buddha-life relief panels), Caves 9-13 (Five Magnificent Caves). Depart Datong after dropping bags at 屿悦民宿, arrive Yungang by 12:30. Depart Yungang by 14:30 to drive toward Hanging Monastery (~90km southeast via 大同绕城高速, ~1.5-2h drive). Take taxi (~30-40 CNY) or Bus 3/4 from city center (~30 min one-way). Verified via RedNote (practical guide with 14 highlight caves, 213 likes).",
            "notes_local": "12:30-14:30票已预订。联合国教科文组织世界遗产，53个洞窟内有5-6世纪雕刻佛像超过45,000尊。重点洞窟：16-20窟（昙曜五窟，坐佛最高达17米）、5-6窟（彩绘藻井、佛传故事浮雕）、9-13窟（五华窟）。放行李后从屿悦民宿出发，12:30前抵达云冈石窟，14:30离开前往悬空寺（东南方向约90公里，经大同绕城高速约1.5-2小时）。从市区乘出租车约30-40元，3/4路公交约30分钟可达。小红书已验证（14个精华洞窟实用攻略，213赞）。",
            "opening_hours": "08:30-17:30 (last entry 16:30)",
            "optional": false,
