          {
            "name_base": "Hanging Monastery (悬空寺)",
            "name_local": "悬空寺",
            "location_base": "Jinlong Canyon, Hunyuan County, Datong, Shanxi (65km south of Datong city)",
            "location_local": "山西省大同市浑源县大磁窑镇203省道恒山山腰金龙峡",
            "coordinates": {
              "lat": 39.660922,
              "lng": 113.726749
            },
            "cost": 130,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "type_base": "Historic Cliff Monastery",
            "type_local": "历史悬崖寺庙",
            "notes_base": "Day 3 afternoon attraction after Yungang Grottoes. Drive ~90km from Yungang (~1.5-2h via 大同绕城高速); buy tickets on-site. One of China's most spectacular architectural achievements: a Buddhist-Taoist-Confucian monastery literally suspended on wooden poles driven into a sheer cliff face, built 1,500+ years ago (Northern Wei dynasty, 491 AD). Only place in China where the Three Teachings (Buddhism, Taoism, Confucianism) coexist in one site. 40 rooms and halls interconnected by plank walkways across the cliff. Views of Jinlong Canyon below. CRITICAL WARNING: Gaode Maps listed the Hanging Monastery as temporarily closed (zanting kaifang). Verify reopening status before visit: check the official WeChat account or call +86-352-8326502. If confirmed open, timed entry groups are strictly limited. Allow 1.5-2 hours on site. Last entry typically 17:00. Return Datong city for dinner after visit.",
            "notes_local": "第3天悬空寺（云冈游览后下午前往）。从云冈驾车约90公里（经大同绕城高速约1.5-2小时），现场购票。中国最壮观的建筑奇迹之一：北魏时期（公元491年）建于恒山绝壁之上的悬空寺，以木桩嵌入岩石支撑，融佛道儒三教于一寺，四十余间殿堂经悬空栈道相连，脚下是金龙峡谷。重要警告：高德地图曾标注悬空寺为暂停开放（暂停开放）。参观前务必确认恢复开放时间，建议致电+86-352-8326502核实。若确认开放，限时限流严格。游览约1.5-2小时，末班入场一般17:00。参观结束后返回大同市区用晚餐。",
            "opening_hours": "08:00-17:30 (subject to reopening — verify before visit)",
            "optional": false,
            "search_results": [
              {
                "skill": "gaode-maps",
                "type": "place_detail",
                "url": "https://uri.amap.com/marker?position=113.726749,39.660922&name=悬空寺",
                "display_text": "Gaode Maps - Hanging Monastery (verify reopening status)"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
