            "type_local": "历史城墙",
            "notes_base": "PRIORITY 4 — walk the restored Ming dynasty city wall surrounding Datong Ancient City. One of the best-preserved ancient city walls in northern China. The wall circuit is ~7.6 km; walk a section (1-2 km) for panoramic views over the ancient city rooflines and surrounding area. Four original gate towers restored. Best light in late afternoon before evening split. Ticket ~30 CNY. Accessible from multiple gates adjacent to Huayan and Shanhua temples. Allow 45-60 min for a section walk. Evening transport split departs from here — Matilde to DAT airport, Jade to Datong South HSR station.",
            "notes_local": "城区优先级4——步行大同古城明代城墙。城墙全长约7.6公里，是华北保存最完好的古城墙之一，四座城门楼均已修复。选走一段（约1-2公里）可俯瞰古城屋脊与周边景色，傍晚光线最美。票价约30元，从华严寺和善化寺附近多处城门均可登城。游览约45-60分钟。傍晚各自出行：Matilde前往大同机场（DAT），Jade前往大同南高铁站。",
