                "type": "geocode",
                "url": "https://uri.amap.com/marker?position=104.029022,30.657467&name=浣花溪公园",
                "display_text": "Gaode Maps - Huanhuaxi Park"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "name_base": "Wuhou Shrine - Red Wall Corridor (武侯祠三义庙红墙夹道)",
            "name_local": "武侯祠",
            "location_base": "231 Wuhouci Street, Wuhou District, Chengdu, Sichuan",
            "location_local": "四川省成都市武侯区武侯祠大街231号",
            "coordinates": {
              "lat": 30.640942,
              "lng": 104.042081
            },
            "cost": 60,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "type_base": "Historic Shrine",
            "type_local": "历史祠堂",
            "notes_base": "[PLAN A - PRIMARY] Mid-day visit 12:00-14:00 (~2h), focusing on INFJ-attuned hidden corners rather than main tourist flow. Key route: enter from north gate, seek out the San Yi Miao (Three Righteousness Temple / 三义庙) — a subsidiary shrine to Liu Bei, Guan Yu, and Zhang Fei, usually quiet. Walk the famous red-wall lanes (红墙夹道) between the mausoleum walls — the most photographed but also most atmospheric narrow alley in the whole site. Finish at the courtyard teahouse inside the grounds for a slow tea. Ticket ~60 CNY. Verified via RedNote (成都文艺citywalk, 3038 likes).",
            "notes_local": "[PLAN A - PRIMARY] 午间游览12:00-14:00（约2小时），以INFJ视角游览武侯祠隐秘角落。路线：从北门进入，先寻访人流较少的三义庙（供奉刘关张三兄弟）；漫步著名的红墙夹道（刘备墓园墙外窄巷，最有氛围感）；最后在祠内茶馆慢饮一杯盖碗茶。门票约60元。小红书已验证（成都文艺citywalk，3038赞）。",
            "opening_hours": "08:00-18:00 (last entry 17:30)",
            "optional": false,
            "search_results": [
