            },
            "cost": 0,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "type_base": "Historic Street",
            "type_local": "历史街区",
            "notes_base": "[PLAN A - PRIMARY] Afternoon light stroll 14:00-15:30 (~1.5h). Exit Wuhou Shrine via the south gate and enter Jinli immediately. Focus on the quieter back alleys of Jinli rather than the central food street, particularly toward dusk when lanterns light up. Look for craft tea stalls serving 老川茶 (traditional Sichuan tea) in small courtyard shops rather than the touristy front row. Red lanterns, ancient-style rooflines — very INFJ atmospheric. Free entry.",
            "notes_local": "[PLAN A - PRIMARY] 午后漫步14:00-15:30（约1.5小时）。从武侯祠南门直接步入锦里，重点游览锦里后巷而非中央美食街，尤其黄昏时分红灯笼亮起最为动人。找找小院茶铺里的老川茶，避开前排热闹商铺。古制屋脊映衬暮色，氛围极佳。免费入场。",
            "opening_hours": "09:00-22:00 (lanterns lit ~18:30)",
            "optional": false,
            "search_results": [
