            },
            "cost": 0,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "type_base": "Historic Alley District",
            "type_local": "历史巷道",
            "notes_base": "[PLAN B - ALTERNATIVE] Skip the tourist-photo front strip of Kuanzhai Alley. Instead: enter via the 窄巷子 (Narrow Alley) east gate, walk only the narrow alley section, and specifically seek out: (1) the Qing dynasty old courtyard residences hidden behind wooden doors — push them gently and some are open courtyards; (2) the small moss-covered grey brick walls with plants growing from cracks; (3) any 民国风格 (Republic-era) small teahouse. The 恺庐 (Kailu) courtyard at Narrow Alley no. 8 is notable for preserved Qing architecture. Go weekday morning or after 19:00 to avoid tour groups. Free entry. Allow 1.5-2 hours.",
            "notes_local": "[PLAN B - ALTERNATIVE] 不走宽窄巷子热门游览线，专走窄巷子段：从东口进，寻访隐于木门后的清代老宅院（有些内院可进入参观）；青苔覆盖的灰砖墙缝间有野花探出；民国风格小茶馆。窄巷子8号的恺庐保存有完好的清代建筑格局，值得细看。工作日早晨或19:00后人群最少。免费入场，建议游览1.5-2小时。",
            "opening_hours": "Open 24 hours (shops 09:00-22:00)",
            "optional": true,
            "search_results": [
