            "name_base": "Xicun Dayuan - Pritzker Prize Architecture (西村大院)",
            "name_local": "西村大院",
            "location_base": "Guoxue Lane, Qingyang District, Chengdu, Sichuan",
            "location_local": "四川省成都市青羊区国学巷西村大院",
            "coordinates": {
              "lat": 30.671288,
              "lng": 104.00373
            },
            "cost": 0,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "type_base": "Architectural Landmark",
            "type_local": "建筑艺术地标",
            "notes_base": "[PLAN B - ALTERNATIVE] 西村大院 by architect Liu Jiakun — the project that won Liu the Pritzker Prize (architecture's Nobel) in 2025, widely called a 'Chengdu Brooklyn' on RedNote. A massive courtyard community combining sports courts, indie cafes, art spaces, and residential blocks all wrapped around one giant interior courtyard with external running track. Most 文艺感 architecture in Chengdu, very 高级感, and almost completely 小众 (most tourists haven't discovered it yet). Free to enter. Walk the perimeter elevated walkway for best views. Verified via RedNote (3984 likes; 638 likes architectural citywalk; multiple 200+ like notes). Allow 1-1.5 hours.",
            "notes_local": "[PLAN B - ALTERNATIVE] 建筑师刘家琨的代表作西村大院——2025年普利兹克奖获奖建筑，小红书称之为\"成都的布鲁克林\"。围绕一个超大内院，融合运动场、独立咖啡、艺术空间与住宅的复合体，外立面有环绕跑道。成都最具文艺感和高级感的建筑地标，游客尚未大量涌入，极小众。免费进入，建议走外圈高架步道俯瞰内院。小红书已验证（3984赞；638赞建筑citywalk；多篇200+赞笔记）。建议游览1-1.5小时。",
            "opening_hours": "Open 24 hours (common areas)",
            "optional": true,
            "search_results": [
