          {
            "name_base": "Yulin Neighborhood Walk - Baiye Bookstore and Little Bar (玉林街区漫步·白夜书店与小酒馆)",
            "name_local": "玉林西路",
            "location_base": "Yulin West Road, Wuhou District, Chengdu, Sichuan",
            "location_local": "四川省成都市武侯区玉林西路",
            "coordinates": {
              "lat": 30.629361,
              "lng": 104.053868
            },
            "cost": 0,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "type_base": "Literary Neighborhood",
            "type_local": "文艺街区",
            "notes_base": "[PLAN C - ALTERNATIVE] The Yulin neighborhood walk is the most hyper-local, INFJ, and 高级感 Chengdu evening activity — and it starts from the hotel's own doorstep (hotel is on 小天东街5号, heart of Yulin). Two anchors: (1) 白夜书店 (Baiye Bookshop) — Chengdu's most legendary literary bar-bookstore, founded by poetess 翟永明 in 1998, with poetry readings, indie art shows, live music, and curated books. (2) 小酒馆 (Little Bar) on Yulin West Road — birthplace of Chengdu's indie music scene. Both are evening venues. Free to walk; drinks from ~30-60 CNY. Verified via RedNote (467 likes by 翟永明 herself; citywalk 3038 likes includes Yulin section).",
            "notes_local": "[PLAN C - ALTERNATIVE] 玉林街区漫步是成都最本地、最INFJ、最高级感的夜间活动——且从酒店门口（小天东街5号，玉林核心）即可出发。两个必打卡点：①白夜书店——1998年由诗人翟永明创办，有诗歌朗诵、独立艺术展和现场音乐；②玉林西路小酒馆——成都独立音乐发源地。均为夜间营业。步行免费，饮品约30-60元。小红书已验证（翟永明本人发文467赞；3038赞citywalk涵盖玉林段）。",
            "opening_hours": "Baiye Bookstore: 14:00-00:00; Little Bar: 20:00-02:00",
            "optional": true,
            "search_results": [
