          {
            "name_base": "Leshan Giant Buddha Scenic Area (乐山大佛景区)",
            "name_local": "乐山大佛",
            "location_base": "2435 Lingyun Road, Shizhong District, Leshan, Sichuan",
            "location_local": "四川省乐山市市中区凌云路2435号",
            "coordinates": {
              "lat": 29.549235,
              "lng": 103.772817
            },
            "cost": 90,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "type_base": "UNESCO World Heritage Site",
            "type_local": "联合国教科文组织世界遗产",
            "notes_base": "[PLAN A - PRIMARY] World's largest stone Buddha (71m), UNESCO listed. Morning session: Take HSR Chengdu East → Leshan (~1h, ~35 CNY). Arrive by 09:00. Combo ticket includes Wuyou Temple (~90 CNY total). Two viewing methods: (1) River boat for full-body frontal view (50 CNY extra, most impressive, book onsite); (2) Walk the cliff stairs 九曲栈道 (Jiuqu plank path) for close-up head-to-toe descent — queue can be 60-90 min in May, start early. Wuyou Temple (乌尤寺) on the small island is included in ticket and far less crowded — a serene Buddhist temple with river views. Complete by 13:00 for onward journey to 五通桥. BOOK TICKETS ONLINE in advance for May (Wechat 乐山旅游 or official site). Allow 3-4 hours total.",
            "notes_local": "[PLAN A - PRIMARY] 世界最大石佛（71米），联合国教科文组织世界遗产。上午段：乘高铁成都东→乐山（约1小时，约35元），09:00前到达。套票含乌尤寺约90元。两种观佛方式：①游船正面观赏全身（另约50元，最震撼，现场购票）；②下九曲栈道近距离从头看到脚——五月排队约60-90分钟，务必早到。乌尤寺在套票内且游客稀少，是有江景的宁静佛寺。13:00前完成，下午前往五通桥。五一务必提前网上购票（微信小程序\"乐山旅游\"或官方网站）。共约3-4小时。",
            "opening_hours": "08:00-18:30 (peak season), boat: 08:30-17:30",
            "optional": false,
            "search_results": [
              {
                "skill": "gaode-maps",
                "type": "geocode",
                "url": "https://uri.amap.com/marker?position=103.772817,29.549235&name=乐山大佛",
                "display_text": "Gaode Maps - Leshan Giant Buddha"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "name_base": "Wutongqiao Old Street - 'Little Venice' Canal Town (五通桥老街·小威尼斯水城)",
            "name_local": "五通桥老街",
            "location_base": "Wutongqiao District, Leshan, Sichuan",
            "location_local": "四川省乐山市五通桥区老街",
            "coordinates": {
              "lat": 29.403365,
              "lng": 103.82994
            },
            "cost": 0,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "type_base": "Historic Water Town",
            "type_local": "历史水乡",
            "notes_base": "[PLAN A - PRIMARY] 五通桥 (Wutongqiao) — the 'Little Venice of Sichuan', approximately 25km from Leshan city center (~30-40 min by taxi/bus). A former salt-industry river town on the Mangxi River (茫溪河) with well-preserved Qing and Republic-era riverside architecture, wooden over-water buildings, canal walks, and stone bridges. Almost no foreign tourists. The old street (老街) runs along the river — lined with traditional tea houses, salt merchants' houses, and locals fishing on the banks. Key spots: Mangxi River Bridge (茫溪河廊桥 covered bridge), riverside boathouse tea spots, 西坝豆腐 (Xiba tofu, the area's famous dish — try at a local restaurant). Very 小众, very 舒适 pace. Free to walk. Budget taxi from Leshan ~40 CNY. Allow 2-3 hours.",
            "notes_local": "[PLAN A - PRIMARY] 五通桥——「四川小威尼斯」，距乐山市区约25公里（出租车/公交约30-40分钟，打车约40元）。保存完好的清代及民国茫溪河盐业古镇，木结构临河建筑、沿河石板路、石桥纵横。外国游客极少，极小众。老街沿河延伸，两侧是传统茶馆、盐商旧宅，当地人在河边垂钓。重点：茫溪河廊桥（传统木廊桥）、河边茶摊、西坝豆腐（当地特色菜，在小馆子吃最正宗）。步行免费，节奏极舒适。建议游览2-3小时。",
            "opening_hours": "Open 24 hours (outdoor town)",
            "optional": false,
            "search_results": [
