            "cost": 100,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "type_base": "Historic Narrow-gauge Railway",
            "type_local": "历史窄轨蒸汽火车",
            "notes_base": "[PLAN B - ALTERNATIVE] 嘉阳小火车 — one of the last operating Republic-era steam narrow-gauge trains in the world (built 1958 for coal mine workers, still using original steam engines). The train runs through forested hills, old coal towns, and countryside for ~20km. Extremely 小众 and photogenic. Departs from 跃进站 (Yuejin Station) in Qianwei County, 芭沟 (Bagou) area. Distance from Leshan: ~50km (~1.5h by taxi, or chartered car). Train schedules: approximately 4 departures daily (09:00, 11:00, 14:00, 16:00 — VERIFY before visit as schedules change seasonally). Round trip ticket ~100-150 CNY. Book in advance via official WeChat 嘉阳小火车景区 or Damai platform. LOGISTICS NOTE: This requires leaving Leshan Giant Buddha by 10:30 latest to reach Qianwei for afternoon train. Very worth it for photography/nostalgia enthusiasts. Allow 2.5-3 hours (train + area walk).",
            "notes_local": "[PLAN B - ALTERNATIVE] 嘉阳小火车——全球少数仍在运行的民国窄轨蒸汽火车之一（1958年为矿工建造，至今使用原蒸汽机车）。列车穿越林间丘陵、老煤矿小镇和乡野，行程约20公里。极小众，画面感极强。发车站：犍为县芭沟镇跃进站。距乐山市区约50公里（出租车约1.5小时或包车前往）。发车时间：每日约4班（09:00/11:00/14:00/16:00——出发前务必确认，时刻表按季节调整）。往返票约100-150元，可提前通过\"嘉阳小火车景区\"微信公众号或大麦网购票。注意：需在10:30前离开乐山大佛以赶上犍为下午班次。摄影控和怀旧爱好者强烈推荐。游览约2.5-3小时。",
            "opening_hours": "09:00-17:00 (verify seasonal schedule)",
            "optional": true,
