            "name_base": "Luocheng Ancient Town - Ship-Shaped Ancient Town (罗城古镇船形街)",
            "name_local": "罗城古镇",
            "location_base": "Luocheng Town, Jianwei County, Leshan, Sichuan",
            "location_local": "四川省乐山市犍为县罗城镇",
            "coordinates": {
              "lat": 29.382785,
              "lng": 104.030536
            },
            "cost": 0,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "type_base": "Historic Ancient Town",
            "type_local": "历史古镇",
            "notes_base": "[PLAN C - ALTERNATIVE] 罗城古镇 — a genuinely mysterious 小众 ancient town with a completely unique layout: the entire main street (船形街) is designed in the shape of a boat, with a covered wooden arcade running the full length, open at the bow end and enclosed at the stern, creating a roofed promenade used by locals as a tea-gathering space for 400 years. The main street is a single long covered wooden shed with Qing dynasty teahouses on both sides — locals sip tea and play mahjong under the wooden roof all day. Almost no foreign visitors. Distance from Leshan: ~45km (~1h by taxi). Free to enter. 高级感 comes from the sheer architectural surreality of the space. Allow 1.5-2 hours. Local 豆花饭 (tofu rice) lunch before exploring. Verified concept via RedNote citywalk content for Sichuan ancient towns.",
            "notes_local": "[PLAN C - ALTERNATIVE] 罗城古镇——极小众且神秘的古镇，全镇布局独特：主街（船形街）整体呈船形，上有清代木结构拱廊屋顶全程覆盖，南端为「船头」开口，北端为「船尾」封闭，形成400余年历史的巨型露天茶棚。两侧是清代茶铺，当地人整日在木屋顶下喝茶打麻将。几乎无外国游客。距乐山市区约45公里（打车约1小时）。免费进入。空间的超现实感才是「高级感」所在。建议游览1.5-2小时，顺吃一顿当地豆花饭午饭。",
            "opening_hours": "Open 24 hours (outdoor town)",
            "optional": true,
