            "cost": 0,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "type_base": "Commercial Walking Street",
            "type_local": "商业步行街",
            "notes_base": "[PLAN A - PRIMARY] Afternoon 13:00-14:00 (~1h). Chengdu's main pedestrian shopping street connecting Taikoo Li northward to the IFS building. Despite being touristy, the INFJ angle is the walking experience — the neon signs, the density of street life, the Chengdu street food vendors and bubble tea stalls, the overall sensory texture of a major Chinese commercial street at golden hour. This is primarily a transit corridor between Taikoo Li and IFS, so treat it as a 15-20 min atmospheric walk rather than a destination. No entry fee. Look up at the building facades for the classic '春熙路' sign and the density of LED signage. Connects directly to IFS Panda Climbing Wall at the south facade.",
            "notes_local": "[PLAN A - PRIMARY] 午后13:00-14:00（约1小时）。成都主步行购物街，向北连接太古里和IFS。INFJ体验在于漫步——霓虹灯牌、烟火气、街头小吃与奶茶摊、大型商业街的感官质感。将其视为从太古里到IFS的15-20分钟氛围通道。免费通行。抬头看\"春熙路\"标牌及密集LED招牌。南侧直连IFS爬楼大熊猫装置。",
            "opening_hours": "Open 24 hours (peak 11:00-22:00)",
