            "cost": 0,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "type_base": "Iconic Street Art Installation",
            "type_local": "地标艺术装置",
            "notes_base": "[PLAN A - PRIMARY] Afternoon 14:00-14:30, quick stop (~20 min) as part of the Chunxi Road walk. The giant 3D panda sculpture appears to climb the south facade of the IFS tower (国金中心) on the Gulou South Street (鼓楼南街) side. Iconic Chengdu photo spot — at dusk or afternoon the lighting on the pandas against the building creates an undeniably striking image. Best photo angle: stand back on the opposite pavement of 鼓楼南街 and shoot upward. Quick stop — do not dedicate more than 20 min. Free to view from street level.",
            "notes_local": "[PLAN A - PRIMARY] 午后14:00-14:30，快速打卡（约20分钟），作为春熙路漫步延伸。巨型3D熊猫装置攀爬于IFS国金中心南立面（鼓楼南街侧）。成都标志性打卡点——最佳拍摄角度：站在鼓楼南街对面人行道向上仰拍。快速打卡，控制在20分钟内。街道层面免费观看。",
