            "name_base": "Fangsuo Bookstore - Taikoo Li Underground (方所书店·太古里店)",
            "name_local": "方所(成都太古里店)",
            "location_base": "B1 Floor M068, 8 Zhongshama Street, Sino-Ocean Taikoo Li, Jinjiang District, Chengdu",
            "location_local": "四川省成都市锦江区中纱帽街8号远洋太古里B1层M068号",
            "coordinates": {
              "lat": 30.658194,
              "lng": 104.080028
            },
            "cost": 0,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "type_base": "Concept Bookstore",
            "type_local": "文艺概念书店",
            "notes_base": "[PLAN A - PRIMARY] Optional literary stop 14:30-15:30 (~1h). 方所 (Fangsuo) is one of China's most celebrated concept bookstores — this is the original Chengdu flagship that made Fangsuo famous. Located in the basement of Taikoo Li (B1), the store is built inside a vaulted underground space that once served as a heritage vault, with cathedral-like columns and reading nooks carved into the walls. Stocks curated books, design objects, art publications, and independent magazines. The architecture alone (dark vaulted ceiling, warm spotlights, irregular stone columns) is worth the visit for Jade's INFJ sensibility. Free to browse. Address: Taikoo Li B1 floor. Gaode confirmed: 方所(成都太古里店), address 中纱帽街8号远洋太古里B1层M068号. Verified via RedNote (太古里怎么走 guide: 1312 likes; 太古里宝藏书店方所 180 likes; 方所异世界图书馆 192 likes).",
            "notes_local": "[PLAN A - PRIMARY] 可选文艺打卡14:30-15:30（约1小时）。方所是中国最受推崇的概念书店之一——成都太古里旗舰店更是让方所成名之地。位于太古里地下B1层，书店建于一处拱形地下空间内（前身为历史保险库），大教堂般的石柱与嵌入墙壁的阅读角落相得益彰。精选书籍、设计品、艺术出版物及独立杂志。仅凭其建筑氛围（深色拱顶、暖光灯、不规则石柱）即值得一游，极适合Jade的INFJ气质。免费入店浏览。高德地图已验证：方所(成都太古里店)，地址：中纱帽街8号远洋太古里B1层M068号。小红书已验证（太古里怎么走攻略1312赞；太古里宝藏书店方所180赞；方所异世界图书馆192赞）。",
            "opening_hours": "10:00-22:00",
            "optional": true,
            "search_results": [
              {
                "skill": "gaode-maps",
                "type": "place_detail",
