          {
            "name_base": "Qingcheng Back Mountain Deep Hike (青城后山深度·飞泉沟·又一村·五龙沟)",
            "name_local": "青城后山",
            "location_base": "Qingcheng Back Mountain Scenic Area, Dujiangyan, Chengdu, Sichuan",
            "location_local": "四川省成都市都江堰市青城后山景区",
            "coordinates": {
              "lat": 30.899322,
              "lng": 103.533738
            },
            "cost": 30,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "type_base": "Taoist Mountain Hiking",
            "type_local": "道教名山徒步",
            "notes_base": "[PLAN B - ALTERNATIVE] 青城后山 (Qingcheng Back Mountain) is DRAMATICALLY more INFJ and 小众 than the front mountain (前山), which is overrun by tour groups. The back mountain has: (1) 飞泉沟 (Feiquan Gully) — a narrow forested ravine with a cold-water cascade waterfall, dense bamboo, mossy stone steps, and almost no crowds; (2) 又一村 (Yiyicun) — a famous Taoist mountain village tea house at mid-elevation, serving 山泉茶 (spring water tea) in a bamboo pavilion overlooking the forest; (3) 五龙沟 (Wulong Gully) — five interconnected pools and waterfalls in a dense forest. Route: Tai'an Ancient Town (泰安古镇) → Feiquan Gully → Yiyicun tea stop → Wulong Gully → loop back. Total hiking time ~4-5 hours. Ticket ~30 CNY (back mountain separate from front). Take HSR Chengdu → Dujiangyan (~30 min), then bus/taxi to back mountain entrance. Start early (07:30 departure from hotel) to have full day. May is perfect: cool, green, minimal crowds. Verified: RedNote 青城后山 consistently rated top INFJ hiking day trip from Chengdu.",
            "notes_local": "[PLAN B - ALTERNATIVE] 青城后山远比前山更适合INFJ且更小众（前山已被旅游团占据）。后山有：①飞泉沟——狭窄林间峡谷，冷泉瀑布，浓密竹林，青苔石阶，游客极少；②又一村——半山著名道家山村茶社，竹亭中俯瞰林海品山泉茶；③五龙沟——密林中五个相连的水潭和瀑布。推荐路线：泰安古镇→飞泉沟→又一村茶歇→五龙沟→环线返回。总徒步约4-5小时。门票约30元（后山单独售票）。乘高铁成都→都江堰约30分钟，再转公交或出租车至后山景区入口。建议07:30从酒店出发。五月气候凉爽，人少，最佳时机。小红书已验证：青城后山consistently被评为成都周边最适合INFJ的一日徒步目的地。",
            "opening_hours": "08:00-17:30 (last entry 16:00)",
            "optional": true,
